            "review_title": "Review at NÚC Concept Kitchen & Bar",
            "review_text": "lyndajoyhowe\nYangon (Rangoon), Myanmar54 contributions\n0\nExceptional food served with love\nOct 2026 • Business\nThis is an exceptional restaurant that centres around a very skilled and creative chef, Tommy, and a dedicated team who serve customers high quality food that tastes amazing and is presented with great care. I ate meals there for one week while working in Ho Chi Minh City and was never disappointed with my menu choices. \nIf you are in the area pay this restaurant a visit\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nMeet the chef if you can. He has a story behind the dishes he creates.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 9, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
