            "review_title": "Review at NÚC Concept Kitchen & Bar",
            "review_text": "Linh T\n3 contributions\n0\nElegant & refined\nSep 2025 • Friends\nMy experience at Núc was truly memorable. The space is minimal yet sophisticated, and every dish is a balance of beautiful presentation and refined flavors. Each course tells a story, crafted with thoughtful techniques that feel both familiar and surprising. A perfect destination for anyone seeking a true fine dining experience in Saigon\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 12, 2025",
