            "review_title": "Review at NÚC Concept Kitchen & Bar",
            "review_text": "Roger\nEugene, Oregon14 contributions\n0\nA hidden gem -\nMar 2025 • Couples\nDon’t pass this up! An unexpectedly great perq to our reservation with Amanaki boutique hotel. A gourmet price fix menu in an atmospheric, quiet environment. Roast duck - much better than any other Asian experience we’ve had - ginger sturgeon, sea urchin and Wagyu beef in multiple courses with a small but thoughtfully composed wine list. Most satisfying, and a definite change of pace from the bustle of most Saigon restaurants. Service from Ms. Han and Ms. Dyen kind and attentive. Don’t miss it!\nRead more\nWritten March 20, 2025",
